OL,3,GNEWSAReform moves to ditch council's
OL,4,A2050 net-zero goal
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders at a county council are seeking
OL,7,Fto abandon a commitment to reach
OL,8,Fnet-zero carbon emissions by 2050.
OL,10,FEast Sussex County Council's (ESCC)
OL,11,Fcabinet has invited the authority's
OL,12,Fscrutiny committees to consider the
OL,13,FReform UK administration's draft
OL,14,Fclimate strategy.
OL,16,FThe policy "resets" existing climate
OL,17,Fcommitments and "prioritises severe
OL,18,Fweather preparedness" over cutting
OL,19,Femissions.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
