OL,3,GNEWSAReform moves to ditch council's
OL,4,A2050 net-zero goal
OL,5,
OL,6,FESCC leader Andy Woolley said a change
OL,7,Fof priority was needed as the cost
OL,8,Fpressures of statutory services had
OL,9,F"intensified", but the Green Party
OL,10,Fcalled it a "dereliction of duty".
